message: "If you use this software, its data, or its verification tooling, please cite the paper below."
type: software
title: "RunuX: Rust reimplementation of Linux kernel subsystems with Lean 4 specifications and AI-agent verification tooling"
abstract: "A research testbed: Rust crates reimplementing Linux kernel subsystems, a Lean 4 specification tree, and open tooling (metrics ratchet, proof oracle, PR guard) that makes human and AI-agent contributions verifiable. Measured status is reported in the README; no production claims are made."
